<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine 9-mth GNP at 7.1 pct vs yr-ago 5.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Philippine 9-mth GNP at 7.1 pct vs yr-ago 5.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines' nine month gross national product grew by 7.1 percent against a 5.3 percent growth in the year-ago period, the National Economic and Development Authority said on Saturday.  </p>
<p>		     9-mth 96    9-mth 95</p>
<p>    GDP	    5.4	   4.9</p>
<p>    GNP	    7.1	   5.3</p>
<p>-Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
